    <td>About three weeks of gnawing epigastric pain, worse before meals and at night and eased by food, with two episodes of black, tarry stools ten days ago and iron-deficiency anemia; stable, Glasgow-Blatchford score 4; peptic ulcer suspected and urgent endoscopy booked</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
